WinTap
======

This project is a Windows port of **LidTap** by Yemcube:
https://github.com/yemcube/lidtap (MIT License)

LidTap's license requires the following attribution on public sharing:

    Based on LidTap by Yemcube (https://github.com/yemcube/lidtap)

The portable core of WinTap (detector, features, model, server, web UI) is
derived from LidTap's source under the same MIT License. The macOS-only IOKit
sensor layer and the macOS shell-action layer were replaced with Windows
equivalents (WinRT sensors / raw HID, RegisterPowerSettingNotification lid
state, low-level keyboard/mouse hooks, SendInput actions); see
`wintap/sources/` and `wintap/actions.py`.

